        {
          "source_quote": "αἱ δὲ παρθένοι ἑστηκυῖαι κύκλῳ τῆς πύλης ἔλεγον τοῖς ἀνδράσι σπεύδειν τὸν πύργον οἰκοδομεῖσθαι.",
          "english_quote": "The virgins around the gate told the men to hurry with the building.",
          "issue": "The simplified edition omits ἑστηκυῖαι, which explicitly describes the virgins as standing around the gate. Their location is retained, but their stated posture is not.",
          "suggested_revision": "Restore “standing,” for example: “The virgins standing around the gate told the men to hurry with the building.” Review the replacement against the source before acceptance.",
          "severity": "minor"
        },
        {
          "source_quote": "καὶ ἐκέλευσαν αὐτοὺς οἱ ἓξ ἄνδρες οἰκοδομεῖν ἐπάνω τῆς πέτρας πύργον τινά.",
