          "severity": "minor"
        },
        {
          "source_quote": "αἱ δὲ παρθένοι τοὺς δέκα λίθους τοὺς πρώτους τοὺς ἐκ τοῦ βυθοῦ ἀναβάντας ἐπετίθουν ἀλλήλαις καὶ κατὰ ἕνα λίθον ἐβάσταζον ὁμοῦ.",
          "english_quote": "Retain rock/gate distinctions, shared carrying, stone counts, the explicitly conjectural negative and the distinction between a pause and completion; preserve all substantive alternative notes.",
          "issue": "The simplification decision claims to preserve a distinction between a pause and completion, but this section contains no such distinction. The metadata therefore reports a source feature that this unit neither contains nor translates.",
